        },
        {
          "text": "Te Yehova nga Zerubabeli Sealitieli mvi, ambo ’ba dri cepi Yudaari pi ma orindi enga, Yosua Yehozadaki mvi kuhani amboruri ma orindi pie, ’ba acepi jolokoru ’diyi ma orindi pie dria; yi emu azi ngazu Yehova asikari ongulumuruni, Mu­i ngu yiniri ma jo alia ra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
